Subject: [PATCH 08/10] [3.1.2] [M156] Ensure XR framebuffers are not bound before
 deleting

Original change's description:
> Ensure XR framebuffers are not bound before deleting
>
> Updates the OpenXR OpenGL ES backend to ensure that framebuffers
> created for the OpenGLESLayerData are not bound before deleting
> them. This can avoid undefined behavior in some drivers.
>
> Fixed: 568899475
